# Evals and Quality Metrics

## Evaluation Suite Requirements
- Automated eval scripts located in `evals/` must benchmark against a committed golden dataset (`evals/golden_dataset.json`).
- Metrics tracked:
  1. Recall@k (RAG retrieval accuracy)
  2. Grounding Score (LLM-as-judge compliance)
  3. Schema Validity Rate (Must be 100%)
  4. Latency (p95) and Token Cost per request
- Failure Gate: CI must fail if schema validity drops below 100% or grounding drops below target thresholds.
